      "value": "<p>You know the @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.Ww5BR9eIXHDFRD61]{Friends} cantrip. Whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can replace it with another cantrip from the Cleric, Druid, or Wizard spell list. Your spellcasting ability for the cantrip of this trait is Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma (chosen when you select this species).</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-9zaUJlocsPn9mEAF\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>To replace the cantrip after a Long Rest, swap the spell on your sheet.</p></section>",
